---
import { contactPath as discoveryUrl } from '../lib/contact.mjs';
---

<section class="section ai-readiness" id="ai-readiness">
  <div class="container ai-readiness__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">05 · AI readiness</p>
      <h2>Prepare the business before turning on AI.</h2>
      <p>AI can amplify weak permissions, scattered information, and unclear data-handling practices. We help establish a safer foundation before wider adoption.</p>
      <a class="button" href={discoveryUrl}>Discuss AI readiness</a>
    </div>
    <ol class="readiness-list">
      <li><span>01</span><p><strong>Review access</strong>Assess Microsoft 365, SharePoint, and business data permissions.</p></li>
      <li><span>02</span><p><strong>Choose useful work</strong>Identify realistic use cases, tools, and licensing requirements.</p></li>
      <li><span>03</span><p><strong>Set boundaries</strong>Document acceptable use and vendor data-handling expectations.</p></li>
      <li><span>04</span><p><strong>Start controlled</strong>Run a measured pilot with staff guidance and success criteria.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
